    "text": "The index of permutability of a group G is defined to be the minimal integer\nk ⩾ 2 such that for each k-tuple x1 , . . . , xk of elements in G there is a non-identity\npermutation σ on k symbols such that x1 · · · xk = xσ(1) · · · xσ(k) . Determine the index\nof permutability of the symmetric group Sn .                                   M. Gutsan",
